   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d via UNICEF f&#xF6;r att m&#xF6;jligg&#xF6;ra skolg&#xE5;ng f&#xF6;r irakiska flyktingbarn . Finansiellt st&#xF6;d till familjer och utveckling av skolsystemet f&#xF6;r att tillgodose behovet av skol platser f&#xF6;r flyktingbarn.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNICEF in order to ensure access to school for the most vulnerable children of Iraqi refugees. Financial support to families for cost of attending school and development of school system in order to facilitate school enrollment for refugee children.</narrative>
